    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051103.0036\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 3 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nShanghai stock index down -- Nov. 3\n\n\n\n\nThe Composite Stock Index on the Shanghai Stock Exchange closed at 1,095.27 points on Thursday, down 9.52 points from the previous close.\n\nA Share Index: 1,151.42 points, down 10.06 points;\n\nB Share Index: 60.13 points, down 0.22 points;\n\nTotal Turnover: 7,510,890,000 yuan.",
